  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIV - Restoration of 35 hectares of degraded pastoral lands in the village of Irrah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of 35 hectares of degraded pastoral land in the village of IRRAH, in the rural commune of Fabidji. The project will employ a participatory approach to involve all socio-professional groups, as well as a &#x2018;cash-for-work&#x2019; scheme to boost the incomes of the communities in the villages concerned.En fran&#xe7;aisRestauration de 35 ha de terres pastorales d&#xe9;grad&#xe9;es du village IRRAHRestauration de 35 ha de terres pastorales d&#xe9;grad&#xe9;es du terroir villageois de IRRAH, cummune rurale de Fabidji. Il sera applique&apos;la d&#xe9;marche participative qui permet d&apos;associer toutes les couches socioprofessionnelles et le &quot;cash for work&quot; qui permet d&apos;am&#xe9;liorer les revenus des populations des villages concern&#xe9;s.</narrative>
  </description>
